---
// B2BContactForm.astro - Acto 7: El Clímax de Conversión (CTA Estratégico B2B)
---

<section id="contacto" class="relative py-24 sm:py-32 px-4 sm:px-6 bg-[#090D16] border-t border-white/5 overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Anchor alias for #cotizar -->
  <div id="cotizar" class="absolute -top-24 pointer-events-none"></div>

  <!-- Radial Glow Behind Card -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[700px] h-[450px] bg-brand-cyan/10 rounded-full blur-[160px] pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-1/4 w-[500px] h-[300px] bg-brand-blue/10 rounded-full blur-[140px] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto relative z-10 text-center">
    
    <!-- Section Eyebrow -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-cyan/10 border border-brand-cyan/20 text-brand-cyan text-xs font-mono mb-6 uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-cyan animate-pulse"></span>
      05 / HABLEMOS DE TU PRÓXIMO EVENTO
    </div>

    <!-- Main Display Title -->
    <h2 class="font-display font-black text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-white tracking-tight uppercase leading-[1.08] mb-6">
      ¿Listo para que tu evento <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
      <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-cyan via-brand-light to-white">
        rompa la inercia?
      </span>
    </h2>

    <!-- Lead Paragraph -->
    <p class="font-body text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-10">
      Cuéntanos la visión de tu marca. Diseñamos puestas en escena masivas, activaciones BTL y experiencias de alto impacto con equipamiento propio y respuesta en menos de 2 horas.
    </p>

    <!-- Main CTA Showcase Card -->
    <div class="gradient-border-card p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-beautiful-lg bg-[#0E1626]/90 backdrop-blur-xl relative overflow-hidden">
      <!-- Ambient corner laser highlight -->
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-brand-cyan/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center">
        <!-- Live Availability Pill -->
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/25 text-emerald-400 text-xs font-mono mb-8">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-ping"></span>
          <span class="font-semibold">Dirección de Cuentas Disponible • Respuesta Express</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Action Buttons Cluster -->
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 w-full mb-10">
          <!-- Primary: WhatsApp Direct Quote -->
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/51948435104?text=Hola%20S%C3%B3nica%20Per%C3%BA%2C%20quisiera%20cotizar%20un%20evento%20corporativo%20o%20activaci%C3%B3n%20BTL"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="beam-glow-btn w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-cyan to-brand-blue hover:from-brand-light hover:to-brand-cyan text-white text-base font-bold px-8 py-4 rounded-xl shadow-glow-cyan transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:translate-y-0 group cursor-pointer"
          >
            <!-- WhatsApp Icon -->
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M.057 24l1.687-6.163c-1.041-1.804-1.588-3.849-1.587-5.946.003-6.556 5.338-11.891 11.893-11.891 3.181.001 6.167 1.24 8.413 3.488 2.245 2.248 3.481 5.236 3.48 8.414-.003 6.557-5.338 11.892-11.893 11.892-1.99-.001-3.951-.5-5.688-1.448l-6.305 1.654zm6.597-3.807c1.676.995 3.276 1.591 5.392 1.592 5.448 0 9.886-4.434 9.889-9.885.002-5.462-4.415-9.89-9.881-9.892-5.452 0-9.887 4.434-9.889 9.884-.001 2.225.651 3.891 1.746 5.634l-.999 3.648 3.742-.981zm11.387-5.464c-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347-.297-.149-1.758-.868-2.031-.967-.272-.099-.47-.149-.669.149-.198.297-.768.967-.941 1.165-.173.198-.347.223-.644.074-.297-.149-1.255-.462-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.297-.347.446-.521.151-.172.2-.296.3-.495.099-.198.05-.372-.025-.521-.075-.148-.669-1.611-.916-2.206-.242-.579-.487-.501-.669-.51l-.57-.01c-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372s-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 1.065 2.876 1.213 3.074c.149.198 2.095 3.2 5.076 4.487.709.306 1.263.489 1.694.626.712.226 1.36.194 1.872.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.695.248-1.29.173-1.414z"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Iniciar Cotización vía WhatsApp</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7" />
            </svg>
          </a>

          <!-- Secondary: Direct Phone Call -->
          <a
            href="tel:+51948435104"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 bg-surface hover:bg-surface-elevated text-slate-200 hover:text-white border border-white/15 hover:border-brand-cyan/40 px-6 py-4 rounded-xl backdrop-blur-md transition-all text-sm font-semibold"
          >
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-cyan" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Llamar a Cuentas: +51 948 435 104</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- 3 Guarantee Badges -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-8 border-t border-white/10 w-full text-left sm:text-center">
          <div class="flex items-center sm:flex-col gap-3 sm:gap-1.5">
            <span class="text-brand-cyan font-mono text-sm font-bold">⚡ &lt; 2 Horas</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">Respuesta inicial y asesoría técnica directa</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center sm:flex-col gap-3 sm:gap-1.5">
            <span class="text-brand-cyan font-mono text-sm font-bold">🛡️ 100% In-House</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">Equipos propios, escenografía y sonido sin intermediarios</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center sm:flex-col gap-3 sm:gap-1.5">
            <span class="text-brand-cyan font-mono text-sm font-bold">📍 Todo el Perú</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">Base central en Lima con despliegue a nivel nacional</span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
